<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In 5 Experiment ‣ XRPO: Pushing the limits of GRPO with Targeted Exploration and Exploitation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2 </span>End-to-end Performance</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.2 End-to-end Performance ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ XRPO: Pushing the limits of GRPO with Targeted Exploration and Exploitation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">XRPO significantly improves post-training model quality.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.2 End-to-end Performance ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ XRPO: Pushing the limits of GRPO with Targeted Exploration and Exploitation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">XRPO achieves substantially faster training convergence.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.2 End-to-end Performance ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ XRPO: Pushing the limits of GRPO with Targeted Exploration and Exploitation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">XRPO</em> achieves better inference efficiency.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
