<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Breaking Symmetry via ICL Seeding</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To address the challenge of systematically unsolved prompts, we integrate a few-shot in-context learning (ICL) seeding strategy into <em id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">XRPO</em> training. Whenever a given prompt fails to produce any successful solution in its base rollouts, the remaining rollout budget is allocated to an ICL-augmented prompt. These ICL prompts incorporate verified solved examples drawn from an evolving corpus of problem–solution pairs that the model has successfully answered in prior training steps. The similarity search for retrieval is conducted using Qwen3-Embedding-8B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2025b</a>)</cite>, ensuring that only the most semantically relevant solved problems are selected as demonstrations. We limit the number of retrieved examples to <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K=2</annotation></semantics></math> in order to conserve context length while still providing sufficient guidance. If no suitable solved examples exist, the prompt falls back to its zero-shot form.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt template is structured into three components: (i) a <span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;task&gt;</span> section containing general instructions, (ii) an <span id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;examples&gt;</span> block containing up to two similar problems and their corresponding verified solutions, and (iii) the new problem to be solved, formatted within a <span id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;new_problem&gt;</span> tag. The model is instructed to extract a general strategy from the examples, reason through the new problem, and finally output the answer in a standardized format (e.g., <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\backslash" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>\</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\backslash</annotation></semantics></math>boxed{} for mathematics or fenced code blocks for programming). To ensure feasibility within the model’s context window, overly long example solutions are truncated as needed.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt Template.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">ICL prompt used in our experiments is shown below:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="194.07" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 194.07" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,194.07) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 188.16 C 0 191.42 2.64 194.07 5.91 194.07 L 544.09 194.07 C 547.36 194.07 550 191.42 550 188.16 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 169.96 L 548.03 169.96 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 178.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">ICL Prompt Template</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.85)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:10.21em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="144.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 141.29)" width="34.88em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><pre id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;task&gt;
  You are given several worked examples, each with a
  &lt;problem&gt; and a &lt;solution&gt;. Extract a general strategy,
  then think through the new problem, and finally provide
  the detailed solution.
&lt;/task&gt;

&lt;examples&gt;
  &lt;example id="1"&gt;
    &lt;problem&gt;[Example problem 1]&lt;/problem&gt;
    &lt;solution&gt;[Correct solution 1]&lt;/solution&gt;
  &lt;/example&gt;

  &lt;example id="2"&gt;
    &lt;problem&gt;[Example problem 2]&lt;/problem&gt;
    &lt;solution&gt;[Correct solution 2]&lt;/solution&gt;
  &lt;/example&gt;
&lt;/examples&gt;

&lt;new_problem&gt;[Hard unsolved problem]&lt;/new_problem&gt;
</pre></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Analysis</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present examples from the AIME 2025 and HMMT 2025 competition sets to illustrate the practical differences between GSPO and XRPO. In Example 1, drawn from the AIME 2025 set, GSPO arrives at an inflated value of <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t=159" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>159</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t=159</annotation></semantics></math> by applying a uniform counting strategy, whereas XRPO carefully distinguishes boundary cases (<math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\pm 7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\pm 7</annotation></semantics></math>), avoids double counting, and correctly filters out invalid tangency conditions, yielding the correct solution <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t=149" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>149</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t=149</annotation></semantics></math>. This methodological precision translates into measurable improvements on this problem XRPO achieves a pass@1 accuracy of 60% compared to only 40% for GSPO.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="111.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 111.81" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,111.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 105.91 C 0 109.17 2.64 111.81 5.91 111.81 L 544.09 111.81 C 547.36 111.81 550 109.17 550 105.91 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 87.7 L 548.03 87.7 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example1: Problem from AIME 2025</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="62.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">There are <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> values of <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in the interval <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;x&lt;2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;x&lt;2\pi</annotation></semantics></math> where</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=\sin\!\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.243em;" width="1.243em"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=\sin\!\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> of these <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> values of <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>, the graph of <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=f(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=f(x)</annotation></semantics></math> is tangent to the <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis.
Find <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t</annotation></semantics></math>. Let’s think step by step and output the final answer within <math id="A2.p2.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mphantom></mphantom></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="760.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 760.54" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,760.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 754.63 C 0 757.89 2.64 760.54 5.91 760.54 L 544.09 760.54 C 547.36 760.54 550 757.89 550 754.63 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 736.43 L 548.03 736.43 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 745.02)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example 1: GSPO</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 14.93)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:51.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.08em;font-size:10pt;" height="710.85" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 709.69)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To solve the given problem, we analyze the function:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are asked to determine the number of values of <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in the interval <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;x&lt;2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;x&lt;2\pi</annotation></semantics></math> for which <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, and then find how many of these are points where the graph is tangent to the <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis. Finally, we compute <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> is the total number of such points and <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of those points where the graph is tangent.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 1: Determine when <math id="A2.p3.pic1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This happens when the argument of the sine function is an integer multiple of <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)=k\pi\quad\Rightarrow\quad\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mspace style="width:1.167em;" width="1.167em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)=k\pi\quad\Rightarrow\quad\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given that <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(\theta)\in[-1,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(\theta)\in[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math>, it follows that <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{k}{7}\in[-1,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{k}{7}\in[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\{-7,-6,\dots,0,\dots,6,7\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\{-7,-6,\dots,0,\dots,6,7\}</annotation></semantics></math>,
for a total of 15 possible values of <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For each <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≠</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the equation <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}</annotation></semantics></math> has <em id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.3.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">two</em> solutions in each <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math> interval. Since <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5x\in(0,10\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5x\in(0,10\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>, which is five full <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math> intervals, we find:</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For </span><math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≠</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: 10 solutions each,</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For </span><math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: 9 solutions (as </span><math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> has 9 solutions in </span><math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(0,10\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(0,10\pi)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=14\times 10+9=149." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">14</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">149</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=14\times 10+9=149.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 2: Determine where the graph is tangent to the <math id="A2.p3.pic1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A function is tangent to the <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis at a point if both <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We compute the derivative:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=\frac{d}{dx}\!\left[\sin\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)\right]=35\pi\cdot\cos\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)\cdot\cos(5x)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">d</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">[</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">35</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=\frac{d}{dx}\!\left[\sin\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)\right]=35\pi\cdot\cos\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)\cdot\cos(5x).</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This derivative is zero when either: <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos\bigl(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\bigr)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, or <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos(5x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos(5x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 3: Find points where <math id="A2.p3.pic1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p3.pic1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We separately analyze the two cases.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 1:</em><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos(5x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos(5x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos(5x)=0\;\Rightarrow\;5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{\pi}{10}+\frac{n\pi}{5}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos(5x)=0\;\Rightarrow\;5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{\pi}{10}+\frac{n\pi}{5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Restricting <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;x&lt;2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;x&lt;2\pi</annotation></semantics></math>, valid values for <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> are <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0,1,2,\dots,9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0,1,2,\dots,9</annotation></semantics></math> (a total of 10 solutions).</span></span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So, the 10 solutions are</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=\frac{\pi}{10},\frac{3\pi}{10},\frac{5\pi}{10},\dots,\frac{19\pi}{10}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">19</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=\frac{\pi}{10},\frac{3\pi}{10},\frac{5\pi}{10},\dots,\frac{19\pi}{10}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">These values are <em id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.5.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">unique</em> and lie within <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(0,2\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(0,2\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now check if each of these satisfies <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}</annotation></semantics></math> for some integer <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≠</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Compute <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5x</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\sin\!\left(\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\right)=\cos(n\pi)=(-1)^{n}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.243em;" width="1.243em"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\sin\!\left(\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\right)=\cos(n\pi)=(-1)^{n}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus,</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\pm 1\;\Rightarrow\;\frac{k}{7}=\pm 1\;\Rightarrow\;k=\pm 7." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\pm 1\;\Rightarrow\;\frac{k}{7}=\pm 1\;\Rightarrow\;k=\pm 7.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So, <em id="A2.p3.pic1.p8.8.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">each of these 10 points</em> satisfies <math id="A2.p3.pic1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, and they are all valid solutions.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 4: Compute <math id="A2.p3.pic1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=149,\qquad t=10\ \text{(number of points where $f(x)=0$ and $f^{\prime}(x)=0$)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">149</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(number of points where </mtext><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> and </mtext><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=149,\qquad t=10\ \text{(number of points where $f(x)=0$ and $f^{\prime}(x)=0$)}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p3.pic1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.pic1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Therefore,</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t=149+10=\boxed{159}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">149</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">159</mn></menclose></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t=149+10=\boxed{159}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1031.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 1031.82" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1031.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 1025.91 C 0 1029.18 2.64 1031.82 5.91 1031.82 L 544.09 1031.82 C 547.36 1031.82 550 1029.18 550 1025.91 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 1007.71 L 548.03 1007.71 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 1016.31)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example 1: XRPO</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 14.93)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:70.9em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.08em;font-size:10pt;" height="982.13" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 980.98)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Understanding the Problem<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are given the function:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">and asked to find the number of values of <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in the interval <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0&lt;x&lt;2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0&lt;x&lt;2\pi</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, denote these as <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>, and then determine how many of these <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> values have the graph of <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p4.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">tangent</span> to the <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis (i.e., <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>), denoted as <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. The problem then requires us to compute <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 1: Solving <math id="A2.p4.pic1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We solve the equation: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin\left(7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)\right)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This implies:
<math id="A2.p4.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)=k\pi\quad\text{for some integer }k\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">for some integer </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\pi\cdot\sin(5x)=k\pi\quad\text{for some integer }k\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\{-7,-6,\dots,0,\dots,6,7\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\{-7,-6,\dots,0,\dots,6,7\}</annotation></semantics></math>, because <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{k}{7}\in[-1,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{k}{7}\in[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p5.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This gives an equation for <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in terms of the integer <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, and the total number of such <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> values in the interval <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(0,2\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(0,2\pi)</annotation></semantics></math> is determined by the number of solutions to <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\frac{k}{7}</annotation></semantics></math> in that domain.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 2: Counting Number of Solutions <math id="A2.p4.pic1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We analyze the number of solutions for each <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 1: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.2.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sin(5x)=0\;\Rightarrow\;5x=n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{n\pi}{5},\quad\text{for }n=1,2,\dots,9." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 5</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">for </mtext><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=0\;\Rightarrow\;5x=n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{n\pi}{5},\quad\text{for }n=1,2,\dots,9.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So there are <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span> such solutions.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.4.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 2: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|k|=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|k|=1</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.4.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\pm 7\;\Rightarrow\;\frac{k}{7}=\pm 1," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\pm 7\;\Rightarrow\;\frac{k}{7}=\pm 1,</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=1\Rightarrow 5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+2n\pi,\qquad\sin(5x)=-1\Rightarrow 5x=\frac{3\pi}{2}+2n\pi." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=1\Rightarrow 5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+2n\pi,\qquad\sin(5x)=-1\Rightarrow 5x=\frac{3\pi}{2}+2n\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Each of these forms a periodic solution in <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(0,2\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(0,2\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>, resulting in <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span> solutions each.
So for <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\pm 7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\pm 7</annotation></semantics></math>, there are <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5+5=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5+5=10</annotation></semantics></math> solutions.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.6" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 3: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|k|&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|k|&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.6.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=-6,-5,\dots,-1\quad\text{and}\quad k=1,2,\dots,6\quad\text{(12 values).}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">and</mtext><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(12 values).</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=-6,-5,\dots,-1\quad\text{and}\quad k=1,2,\dots,6\quad\text{(12 values).}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Each of these values has <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{k}{7}\in(-1,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{k}{7}\in(-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Each such value of <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)</annotation></semantics></math> has <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span> distinct solutions per period of <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math>, so over 5 full periods (since <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta=5x\in(0,10\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta=5x\in(0,10\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>), the total is <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.7.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10 solutions per <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></span>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Therefore, for 12 such <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-values, we get <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="12\times 10=120" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">12</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">12\times 10=120</annotation></semantics></math> solutions.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p6.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Total Number of Solutions <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=9\text{ (from }k=0)+10\text{ (from }k=\pm 7)+120\text{ (other $k$ values)}=139." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" fence="true" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" fence="true" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> (from </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> (from </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">120</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> (other </mtext><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> values)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">139</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=9\text{ (from }k=0)+10\text{ (from }k=\pm 7)+120\text{ (other $k$ values)}=139.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 3: Finding <math id="A2.p4.pic1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> — Tangent Points</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A point is tangent to the <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis if and only if <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0\quad\text{and}\quad f^{\prime}(x)=0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">and</mtext><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0\quad\text{and}\quad f^{\prime}(x)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">From the derivative:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=\frac{d}{dx}\bigl[\sin(7\pi\sin(5x))\bigr]=35\pi\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))\cos(5x)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">d</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">35</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=\frac{d}{dx}\bigl[\sin(7\pi\sin(5x))\bigr]=35\pi\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))\cos(5x).</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math> when: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\quad\cos(5x)=0\quad\text{or}\quad\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))=0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">or</mtext><mspace style="width:1.167em;" width="1.167em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\quad\cos(5x)=0\quad\text{or}\quad\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.4" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.4.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case A: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos(5x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos(5x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.4.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{\pi}{10}+\frac{n\pi}{5}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5x=\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\;\Rightarrow\;x=\frac{\pi}{10}+\frac{n\pi}{5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">With <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in(0,2\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in(0,2\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>, the valid <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> are from <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m44" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m45" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9</annotation></semantics></math>, producing <span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10 distinct values</span>. Each such <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m46" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m47" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>, since <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m48" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\sin\!\left(\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\right)=(-1)^{n}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.243em;" width="1.243em"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\sin\!\left(\frac{\pi}{2}+n\pi\right)=(-1)^{n}.</annotation></semantics></math>
Thus, <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m49" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\pm 7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\pm 7</annotation></semantics></math>, and these are valid.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.6" class="ltx_p"><em id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case B: <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m50" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos(7\pi\sin(5x))=0</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.6.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\pi\sin(5x)=\frac{\pi}{2}+m\pi\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\frac{m+1/2}{7}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\pi\sin(5x)=\frac{\pi}{2}+m\pi\;\Rightarrow\;\sin(5x)=\frac{m+1/2}{7}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This would require <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m51" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sin(5x)=\frac{m+1/2}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sin(5x)=\frac{m+1/2}{7}</annotation></semantics></math>, but since <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m52" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\in\mathbb{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℤ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\in\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>, this introduces fractional values that cannot match the integer <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m53" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\frac{m}{7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\frac{m}{7}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m54" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\mathbb{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℤ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, no such <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m55" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> can satisfy both <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m56" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p4.pic1.m57" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{\prime}(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{\prime}(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Final Calculation<span id="A2.p4.pic1.p7.8.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+t=139+10=\boxed{149}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">139</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">149</mn></menclose></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+t=139+10=\boxed{149}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="A2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Example 2 is drawn from the HMMT 2025 set, the problem involves evaluating a challenging floor sum where GSPO applies a uniform pairing strategy and arrives at the incorrect final result of -1985, while XRPO carefully splits the sum into cases, distinguishes positive and negative indices, accounts for odd divisors of 4050, and arrives at the correct answer of -984. This refinement again highlights XRPO’s superior reasoning rigor and ability to handle intricate floor and ceiling interactions, leading to measurable gains on this promblem XRPO achieves a pass@1 accuracy of 21.8% compared to only 9.37% for GSPO.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="112.5" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 112.5" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,112.5) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4DFF;" fill="#4D4DFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 106.59 C 0 109.85 2.64 112.5 5.91 112.5 L 544.09 112.5 C 547.36 112.5 550 109.85 550 106.59 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 88.39 L 548.03 88.39 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.98)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example 2: Problem from HMMT 2025</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:4.34em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="62.8" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 60.11)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p6.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p6.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let <math id="A2.p6.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lfloor z\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lfloor z\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math> denote the greatest integer less than or equal to <math id="A2.p6.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>. Compute</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p6.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p6.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let’s think step by step and output the final answer within .</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p7.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="854" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 854" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,854) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4DFF;" fill="#4D4DFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 848.1 C 0 851.36 2.64 854 5.91 854 L 544.09 854 C 547.36 854 550 851.36 550 848.1 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 829.89 L 548.03 829.89 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 838.49)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example 2: GSPO</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:58.13em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="804.31" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 804.31)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To compute the following sum:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">we begin by simplifying the expression inside the floor function.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 1: Reduce the Expression<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We note that:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{2025}{j+0.5}=\frac{2025}{\frac{2j+1}{2}}=\frac{4050}{2j+1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{2025}{j+0.5}=\frac{2025}{\frac{2j+1}{2}}=\frac{4050}{2j+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Hence, the original sum can be rewritten as:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 2: Change of Variables<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let’s make a substitution to simplify the range of <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=j+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=j+1</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2j+1=2(n-1)+1=2n-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2j+1=2(n-1)+1=2n-1</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, the sum becomes:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor=\sum_{n=1}^{2001}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2n-1}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor=\sum_{n=1}^{2001}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2n-1}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is valid for <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1,2,\dots,2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1,2,\dots,2001</annotation></semantics></math>, since: When <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=-1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=-1000</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2j+1=-1999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1999</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2j+1=-1999</annotation></semantics></math> and for <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1000</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2j+1=2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2j+1=2001</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, the total sum becomes:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{n=1}^{2001}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2n-1}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{n=1}^{2001}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2n-1}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 3: Use Symmetry and Pairing<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The sum is a bit complex to directly evaluate due to the floor function and the range of <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>. However, we note that:</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For any integer <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\mathbb{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℤ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A2.p7.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor=\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor=\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">But since <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{-k}\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil</annotation></semantics></math>, this becomes:<math id="A2.p7.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We denote <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=\frac{4050}{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=\frac{4050}{k}</annotation></semantics></math> and observe that: If <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> is an integer, then <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lfloor x\rfloor-\lceil x\rceil=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lfloor x\rfloor-\lceil x\rceil=0</annotation></semantics></math> and if <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> is not an integer, then <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lfloor x\rfloor-\lceil x\rceil=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lfloor x\rfloor-\lceil x\rceil=-1</annotation></semantics></math>. So, for all <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=\frac{4050}{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=\frac{4050}{k}</annotation></semantics></math> is not an integer, the contribution to the total sum is <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>, and for those where <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> is an integer, it contributes <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 4: Count the Terms Where <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{4050}{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{4050}{k}</annotation></semantics></math> is Not an Integer<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We first determine all odd integers <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2n-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2n-1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1,2,\dots,2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1,2,\dots,2001</annotation></semantics></math>, such that <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> divides <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4050" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4050</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prime factorization of 4050:<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4050=2\cdot 3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4050=2\cdot 3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. Since we are only interested in odd divisors (i.e., not including the <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math>), the odd divisors are the divisors of <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}=81\cdot 25=2025" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">81</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">25</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}=81\cdot 25=2025</annotation></semantics></math>. The number of odd divisors of <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2025" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2025</annotation></semantics></math> is:<math id="A2.p7.pic1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(4+1)(2+1)=15." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">15</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(4+1)(2+1)=15.</annotation></semantics></math> From these, we exclude the divisor <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2025" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2025</annotation></semantics></math> itself (since <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2001</annotation></semantics></math> is the largest <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> allowed, but <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2025&gt;2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2025&gt;2001</annotation></semantics></math>), leaving <span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span> valid odd divisors less than or equal to <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2001</annotation></semantics></math>. So, among the <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2001</annotation></semantics></math> terms in the range <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2001</annotation></semantics></math>, <span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.16.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14 of them</span> make <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{4050}{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{4050}{k}</annotation></semantics></math> an integer.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 5: Final Computation<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Each of the <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="14" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">14</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">14</annotation></semantics></math> terms where <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m44" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> is an integer contributes <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m45" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math>, and the remaining <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m46" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2001-14=1987" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">14</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1987</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2001-14=1987</annotation></semantics></math> terms contribute <math id="A2.p7.pic1.m47" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math> each.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, the total sum is:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1987\cdot(-1)+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2001}\right\rfloor=-1987+2=-1985." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1987</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1987</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1985</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1987\cdot(-1)+\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2001}\right\rfloor=-1987+2=-1985.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Final Answer<span id="A2.p7.pic1.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{-1985}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1985</mn></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{-1985}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p8.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="840.1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 840.1" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,840.1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4DFF;" fill="#4D4DFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 834.19 C 0 837.45 2.64 840.1 5.91 840.1 L 544.09 840.1 C 547.36 840.1 550 837.45 550 834.19 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 815.99 L 548.03 815.99 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 824.58)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example 2: XRPO</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:56.87em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="790.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 786.95)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To evaluate the sum</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{2025}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor,</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">we begin by analyzing the structure of the expression. The key transformation is that:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j+0.5=\frac{2j+1}{2},\quad\text{so}\quad\frac{2025}{j+0.5}=\frac{4050}{2j+1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">so</mtext><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2025</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j+0.5=\frac{2j+1}{2},\quad\text{so}\quad\frac{2025}{j+0.5}=\frac{4050}{2j+1}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, the sum becomes:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=-1000}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 1: Splitting the Sum<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We split the sum into three distinctly defined segments:</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. <span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">From <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=-1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=-1000</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Let <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=-m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=-m</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math>, so:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex34" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{4050}{2j+1}=\frac{4050}{-2m+1}=-\frac{4050}{2m-1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{4050}{2j+1}=\frac{4050}{-2m+1}=-\frac{4050}{2m-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Then, since <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor x\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor x\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil</annotation></semantics></math>, we get:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex35" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{j+0.5}\right\rfloor=-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So, the sum becomes:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex36" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sum_{m=1}^{1000}-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{m=1}^{1000}-\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. <span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">At <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=0</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex37" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{1}\right\rfloor=\left\lfloor 4050\right\rfloor=4050." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{1}\right\rfloor=\left\lfloor 4050\right\rfloor=4050.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. <span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">From <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math>:</span> Here, the argument <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2j+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2j+1</annotation></semantics></math> is an odd integer in the range from <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2001</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2001</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex38" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 2: Defining the Key Quantities<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F=\sum_{j=1}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">j</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F=\sum_{j=1}^{1000}\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{2j+1}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\sum_{m=1}^{1000}\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1000</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\sum_{m=1}^{1000}\left\lceil\frac{4050}{2m-1}\right\rceil</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Then, the total sum becomes:
<math id="A2.p8.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Total}=4050+F-C." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">Total</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Total}=4050+F-C.</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now, consider for each odd integer <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2m-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2m-1</annotation></semantics></math>, from <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1999</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1999</annotation></semantics></math>, the relationship between <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For each <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> not dividing <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4050" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4050</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil&gt;\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌈</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌉</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌊</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\lceil\frac{4050}{k}\right\rceil&gt;\left\lfloor\frac{4050}{k}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>, so the difference is <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, the total difference <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F-C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F-C</annotation></semantics></math> is: <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F-C=-N-4050+2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F-C=-N-4050+2</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of odd divisors of <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4050" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4050</annotation></semantics></math> in the range from <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1999</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1999</annotation></semantics></math> (inclusive).</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 3: Counting the Odd Divisors of 4050<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The prime factorization of <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4050=2^{1}\cdot 3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4050=2^{1}\cdot 3^{4}\cdot 5^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, so the odd divisors are of the form:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex39" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3^{a}\cdot 5^{b},\quad a\in\{0,1,2,3,4\},\quad b\in\{0,1,2\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3^{a}\cdot 5^{b},\quad a\in\{0,1,2,3,4\},\quad b\in\{0,1,2\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Total such divisors: <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(4+1)(2+1)=15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(4+1)(2+1)=15</annotation></semantics></math>, but we only consider those <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≥</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq 3</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq 1999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≤</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq 1999</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">After enumerating, we find that <span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span> of these divisors are between <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p8.pic1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1999</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1999</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">So N = 999 - 13 = 986.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 4: Final Computation<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.22.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p8.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now plug into the formula:</span></span>
<span id="A2.Ex40" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Total}=4050+(F-C)=4050+(-N-4050+2)=2-N=2-986=\boxed{-984}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">Total</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4050</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">986</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">984</mn></mrow></menclose></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Total}=4050+(F-C)=4050+(-N-4050+2)=2-N=2-986=\boxed{-984}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
